      "id": 1,
      "text": "Mankato’s name came from the Dakota word for blue clay, but a clerk’s typo turned Mahkato into the city’s current name.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        10,
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
